.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# #338 — never bake operator-owned runtime config into an image (defense in depth; real secrets live
# in .env, but system_config.yaml is operator-owned and injected at runtime, never copied into layers).
system_config.yaml
**/system_config.yaml
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.pnpm-store
**/test-results
**/.turbo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/*.log
artifacts/
output/
tmp/
dist/
build/
coverage/

backups/
**/backups/
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
# #338 — exclude the old public/VPS deploy dir from image contexts, but KEEP deploy/acceptance/ so the
# gateapi image can carry its committed init orchestrator + entrypoint (no host-local build input).
deploy/stitch-vps/
